{
  "$defs": {
    "Budget": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "A size cap (PRO-03): the allocated bytes of every candidate matching all the given filters\nmust stay at or below `max_gib`. A budget with no filter caps everything scull found.",
      "properties": {
        "category": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/Category"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "Only candidates of this category (e.g. `project_artifact`, `package_cache`)."
        },
        "ecosystem": {
          "description": "Only candidates whose project ecosystem is this (e.g. `rust`, `node`).",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "max_gib": {
          "description": "The cap, in GiB.",
          "format": "uint32",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "path": {
          "description": "Only candidates inside this directory (`~` allowed).",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "max_gib"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "Category": {
      "description": "Broad category of a candidate, used for grouping in the CLI, charts and Quick Clean.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "const": "project_artifact",
          "description": "Build output or dependencies inside a project (`target/`, `node_modules`, `.next`, …).",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "package_cache",
          "description": "Global package-manager cache (Quick Clean, QC-01).",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "worktree",
          "description": "A Git worktree, whole or stale registration.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "ml_cache",
          "description": "ML/AI model or dataset cache.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "container",
          "description": "Docker / container data.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "large_file",
          "description": "Large file surfaced for inspection only.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "scull_data",
          "description": "scull's own data (database, logs, quarantine; DATA-05).",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "other",
          "description": "Anything else.",
          "type": "string"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ColorChoice": {
      "description": "When to use color in terminal output.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "const": "auto",
          "description": "Color when writing to a terminal and `NO_COLOR` is unset.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "always",
          "description": "Always color.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "never",
          "description": "Never color.",
          "type": "string"
        }
      ]
    },
    "DurationSpec": {
      "description": "A duration: a whole number followed by s, m, h, d or w (e.g. \"24h\").",
      "pattern": "^\\s*[0-9]+[smhdw]\\s*$",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "ForgeLayer": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "`[forge]` in a [`ConfigLayer`].",
      "properties": {
        "enabled": {
          "description": "Whether forge lookups are allowed.",
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "object"
    },
    "McpLayer": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "`[mcp]` in a [`ConfigLayer`].",
      "properties": {
        "destructive": {
          "description": "Destructive tools. Only honored from the user config file (see [`resolve`]).",
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "enabled": {
          "description": "Whether the MCP server may run.",
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "hash_names": {
          "description": "Hash project and directory names in results.",
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "max_pending_plans": {
          "description": "Most agent plans awaiting approval per machine and user. Only honored from the user\nconfig file (see [`resolve`]).",
          "format": "uint32",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "max_results": {
          "description": "Maximum results per tool call.",
          "format": "uint32",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "prepare_per_minute": {
          "description": "Most `prepare_cleanup` calls per minute in one MCP session. Only honored from the user\nconfig file (see [`resolve`]).",
          "format": "uint32",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "redact_home": {
          "description": "Replace the home prefix with `~` in results.",
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "object"
    },
    "OutputLayer": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "`[output]` in a [`ConfigLayer`].",
      "properties": {
        "color": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/ColorChoice"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "When to use color."
        },
        "units": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/SizeUnits"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "How to print sizes."
        }
      },
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ProactiveLayer": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "`[proactive]` in a [`ConfigLayer`](super::ConfigLayer). See [`ProactiveConfig`].",
      "properties": {
        "alert_days": {
          "description": "See [`ProactiveConfig::alert_days`].",
          "format": "uint32",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "budgets": {
          "description": "See [`ProactiveConfig::budgets`].",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/Budget"
          },
          "type": [
            "array",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "reserve_gib": {
          "description": "See [`ProactiveConfig::reserve_gib`].",
          "format": "uint32",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "spike_gib": {
          "description": "See [`ProactiveConfig::spike_gib`].",
          "format": "uint32",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "spike_min_gib": {
          "description": "See [`ProactiveConfig::spike_min_gib`].",
          "format": "uint32",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "spike_percent": {
          "description": "See [`ProactiveConfig::spike_percent`].",
          "format": "uint32",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "spike_window": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/DurationSpec"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "See [`ProactiveConfig::spike_window`]."
        },
        "stale_build": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/DurationSpec"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "See [`ProactiveConfig::stale_build`]."
        },
        "stale_cache": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/DurationSpec"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "See [`ProactiveConfig::stale_cache`]."
        },
        "stale_worktree": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/DurationSpec"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "See [`ProactiveConfig::stale_worktree`]."
        }
      },
      "type": "object"
    },
    "QuarantineLayer": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "`[quarantine]` in a [`ConfigLayer`]. See [`super::QuarantineConfig`].",
      "properties": {
        "base": {
          "description": "Directory that holds `.scull-quarantine` for items on its volume (replaces lower\nlayers).",
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "bases": {
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "description": "Per volume (or directory) → base directory (replaces lower layers).",
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "object"
    },
    "RulesLayer": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "`[rules]` in a [`ConfigLayer`].",
      "properties": {
        "enabled": {
          "description": "IDs of optional rules to enable (replaces lower layers).",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": [
            "array",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ScanLayer": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "`[scan]` in a [`ConfigLayer`]. See [`super::ScanConfig`] for the meaning of each field.",
      "properties": {
        "activity_window": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/DurationSpec"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "Activity window, e.g. `\"24h\"`."
        },
        "exclude": {
          "description": "Paths never scanned (added to lower layers).",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": [
            "array",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "low_resource": {
          "description": "Low-resource mode.",
          "type": [
            "boolean",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "min_tier": {
          "additionalProperties": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/Tier"
          },
          "description": "Minimum tier per path (added to lower layers; the most protective tier wins).",
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "protect": {
          "description": "Protected paths, always S3 (added to lower layers).",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": [
            "array",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "roots": {
          "description": "Directories to scan (replaces lower layers).",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": [
            "array",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "threads": {
          "description": "Scanner threads; `0` picks automatically.",
          "format": "uint32",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "object"
    },
    "SizeUnits": {
      "description": "How sizes are printed.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "const": "binary",
          "description": "Powers of 1024 (KiB, MiB, GiB).",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "decimal",
          "description": "Powers of 1000 (kB, MB, GB).",
          "type": "string"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Tier": {
      "description": "How much risk removing an item carries.\n\nThe ordering is by **protectiveness**: `S0 < S1 < S2 < S3`. Combining evidence always takes\nthe maximum (the most protective tier), and a tier may only ever move *up* this order after a\nscan (invariant I-8: tiers never decrease on revalidation).",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "const": "S0",
          "description": "Regenerable: a verified generated artifact, reproducible from tracked inputs.\nPreselected for review, but never executed without confirmation.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "S1",
          "description": "Costly to recreate: reproducible, but needs a significant download or build. Opt-in.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "S2",
          "description": "Uncertain: ownership, activity or reproducibility is unclear. Never preselected.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "S3",
          "description": "Protected: possibly unique data, in active use, or explicitly protected. Never acted on.",
          "type": "string"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "$id": "https://scull.dev/schemas/v1/config.schema.json",
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "One trusted configuration source with every field optional: the user config file, the\nenvironment ([`EnvLayer`]) or CLI flags. `None` means \"not set here\".\n\nThis is also the **user config file format** (TOML). Unknown keys are rejected:\n\n```toml\n[scan]\nroots = [\"~/Projects\", \"~/work\"]\nexclude = [\"~/Projects/huge-monorepo\"]\nprotect = [\"~/Projects/thesis\"]\nactivity_window = \"48h\"\nthreads = 0              # 0 = automatic\nlow_resource = false\n\n[scan.min_tier]\n\"~/Projects/legacy\" = \"S2\"\n\n[rules]\nenabled = [\"community.unity-library\"]\n\n[mcp]\nenabled = true\ndestructive = false\nredact_home = true\nhash_names = false\nmax_results = 1000\nmax_pending_plans = 5    # agent plans awaiting approval (file only)\nprepare_per_minute = 6   # prepare_cleanup calls per session per minute (file only)\n\n[forge]\nenabled = false\n\n[output]\ncolor = \"auto\"           # auto | always | never\nunits = \"binary\"         # binary | decimal\n\n[proactive]              # alert policies; see `ProactiveConfig`\nreserve_gib = 10\nalert_days = 14\n\n[quarantine]             # optional; see `QuarantineConfig`\nbase = \"~/.scull-q\"\n\n[quarantine.bases]       # optional, per volume\n\"/Volumes/Data\" = \"/Volumes/Data/me/.q\"\n```",
  "properties": {
    "forge": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ForgeLayer",
      "description": "Git forge lookups."
    },
    "mcp": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/McpLayer",
      "description": "The MCP server."
    },
    "output": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/OutputLayer",
      "description": "Terminal output."
    },
    "proactive": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ProactiveLayer",
      "description": "Alert policies (user config file only)."
    },
    "quarantine": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/QuarantineLayer",
      "description": "Where quarantined items are kept."
    },
    "rules": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/RulesLayer",
      "description": "Optional rules."
    },
    "scan": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ScanLayer",
      "description": "What to scan and how."
    }
  },
  "title": "ConfigLayer",
  "type": "object"
}
